{"id":"vod_bf_29666","vodId":"29666","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"少年同盟第二季","name_cn":"少年同盟第二季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-30/760dea01603be16edb57aa28c77f1d82.jpg"},"summary":"故事以5个高中二年级学生的校园生活为主线，双胞胎兄弟浅羽悠太和佑希，和他们的青梅竹马——冢原要和松冈春，以及转校生橘千鹤。他们共同经历了一季的校园生活，今后的他们，将又迎来怎样美好的青春故事呢？　　新的学期又开始了，5个少年迎来了人生中第17个冬季。这天，他们一起去冢原要家吃饭，饭后他们决定都留下来过夜……圣诞节来临，他们又遇到怎么样的小状况呢……一个个温馨幽默的小故事，就这样每天在他们身边发生；个性不同的人物也一个个陆续登场……他们的生活看似一如既往的平淡，却在他们不经意的时候悄悄发生了变化。在吵吵闹闹、诙谐悠闲的日常中，折射出5个少年真真实实、美好温馨的青春岁月。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:05:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/shaoniantongmengdierji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/s